# Jungle Hijinxs HD tile dump route (DKC1_HD_DUMP, widescreen).
# Same deterministic entry as route_jungle.dks, then a fixed run/roll/jump
# cycle: Y rolls through Gnawties and Kritters, B clears steps and gaps.
# The Kongs do die on the way; the cycle re-enters the level from the map,
# which also dumps the map, entrance and death-transition tiles.
wait 0032 == 0001 timeout 600
0 * 5100
pulse 8 6 120 003e == 00eb timeout 6000
pulse 8 6 120 003e == 00ec timeout 2000
pulse 8 6 120 003e == 0016 timeout 2000
0 * 1500
pulse 8 8 150 0028 <= 0008 timeout 4000
wait 1b25 >= 0100 timeout 600
wait 088b <= 0100 timeout 600
checkpoint level_entry
